wer-field/choices "answer-95309e0e-fd50-5c5e-b095-3c20e548ce32"] ["answer-field-7d4432d3-c731-55d8-bd24-6b2c198e1059" :answer-field/choices "answer-082e1fb8-38d1-5dd8-8994-bb44202783c0"] ["question-a1dae329-b51c-5003-8d13-154486e1f8af" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-7d4432d3-c731-55d8-bd24-6b2c198e1059"] [17592186068714 :knowledge-point/questions "question-a1dae329-b51c-5003-8d13-154486e1f8af"] ["question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc" :question/id #uuid "ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc"] ["question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc" :question/math-academy-id "q-60182"] ["question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc" :question/problem "The lines $y=3x-b$ and $y=x+5$ intersect at the point $C$ with coordinates $(a,2).$ Find the parameters $a$ and $b.$"] ["question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc" :question/worked-solution "Since $(a,2)$ is the point of intersection of the two lines, the values $x=a,\\,y=2$ must solve the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y=3x-b \\\\ y=x+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute $x=a,\\,y=2$ to obtain a new system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2=3a-b \\\\ 2=a+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve for $a$ in the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & =a+5 \\\\ -3 & =a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we can substitute $a=-3$ into the first equation and solve for $b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2 & =3a-b \\\\ 2 & =3(-3)-b \\\\ 2 & =-9-b \\\\ 11 & =-b \\\\ -11 & =b\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=-3$ and $b=-11.$"] ["question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/id #uuid "799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe"] ["answer-602e967c-a929-567a-9257-15cb77561af6" :answer/id #uuid "602e967c-a929-567a-9257-15cb77561af6"] ["answer-602e967c-a929-567a-9257-15cb77561af6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-602e967c-a929-567a-9257-15cb77561af6" :answer/value "a=-2,\\,b=5"] ["answer-011c4ed3-b08e-5bb4-8d64-714af50167c9" :answer/id #uuid "011c4ed3-b08e-5bb4-8d64-714af50167c9"] ["answer-011c4ed3-b08e-5bb4-8d64-714af50167c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-011c4ed3-b08e-5bb4-8d64-714af50167c9" :answer/value "a=-3,\\,b=-11"] ["answer-156f3b79-c1f4-564c-9343-71d9780571e6" :answer/id #uuid "156f3b79-c1f4-564c-9343-71d9780571e6"] ["answer-156f3b79-c1f4-564c-9343-71d9780571e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-156f3b79-c1f4-564c-9343-71d9780571e6" :answer/value "a=0,\\,b=-2"] ["answer-46ace411-49e7-5267-8ce7-27b0b740cb4a" :answer/id #uuid "46ace411-49e7-5267-8ce7-27b0b740cb4a"] ["answer-46ace411-49e7-5267-8ce7-27b0b740cb4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-46ace411-49e7-5267-8ce7-27b0b740cb4a" :answer/value "a=3,\\,b=-9"] ["answer-6a59c9dc-7269-58a8-99a5-540b40f347b9" :answer/id #uuid "6a59c9dc-7269-58a8-99a5-540b40f347b9"] ["answer-6a59c9dc-7269-58a8-99a5-540b40f347b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6a59c9dc-7269-58a8-99a5-540b40f347b9" :answer/value "a=4,\\,b=1"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/correct "answer-011c4ed3-b08e-5bb4-8d64-714af50167c9"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/choices "answer-602e967c-a929-567a-9257-15cb77561af6"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/choices "answer-011c4ed3-b08e-5bb4-8d64-714af50167c9"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/choices "answer-156f3b79-c1f4-564c-9343-71d9780571e6"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/choices "answer-46ace411-49e7-5267-8ce7-27b0b740cb4a"] ["answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe" :answer-field/choices "answer-6a59c9dc-7269-58a8-99a5-540b40f347b9"] ["question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-799a5806-fdb3-56b9-abdb-217c2f17b6fe"] [17592186068715 :knowledge-point/questions "question-ea2f44ab-dddd-5fb6-b2ba-34d59e15c7bc"] ["question-e70442d3-8437-54dd-ba25-74163c48588a" :question/id #uuid "e70442d3-8437-54dd-ba25-74163c48588a"] ["question-e70442d3-8437-54dd-ba25-74163c48588a" :question/math-academy-id "q-75873"] ["question-e70442d3-8437-54dd-ba25-74163c48588a" :question/problem "Find the point of intersection of the lines $2x+y=12$ and $x-2y=6.$"] ["question-e70442d3-8437-54dd-ba25-74163c48588a" :question/worked-solution "We need to solve the system of equations consisting of the two lines:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+y=12 \\\\ x-2y=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe will use the elimination method to solve the system. Notice that if we multiply the first equation by $2,$ then we will get a $2y$ term that can cancel with the $-2y$ in the second equation:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+y=12 & |\\,\\times 2 \\\\ x-2y=6 & \\end{aligned}\\,⟹\\,\\{\\begin{aligned}4x+2y=24 \\\\ x-2y=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdding the two equations eliminates the $y$-variable and allows us to solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x+\\cancel{2y} & =24 \\\\ x-\\cancel{2y} & =6 \\\\ (4x+x) & =(24+6) \\\\ 5x & =30 \\\\ x & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can substitute $x=6$ into the equation $x-2y=6$ to solve for $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y & =6 \\\\ 6-2y & =6 \\\\ -2y & =0 \\\\ y & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system is $x=6,\\,y=0.$ So the coordinates of the point of intersection are $(6,0).$"] ["question-e70442d3-8437-54dd-ba25-74163c48588a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-906a9694-dc14-5b8b-9fcf-596a282ca62d" :answer-field/id #uuid "906a9694-dc14-5b8b-9fcf-596a282ca62d"] ["answer-08848abb-4fdd-54a8-a134-d62409d65dd8" :answer/id #uuid "08848abb-4fdd-54a8-a134-d62409d65dd8"] ["answer-08848abb-4fdd-54a8-a134-d62409d65dd8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-08848abb-4fdd-54a8-a134-d62409d65dd8" :answer/value "(0,